{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、ななちゃんずで欅に入って初めて(👈重要)ご飯に行ってきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゃぶしゃぶ を食べました🍲。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ6FKR9ZHDQEMXNN4ZKHJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ7FG67N1X1SEEXMWXWAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nちゃんと卵たくさん食べたよ🥚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リゾットを作るだに。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ8FHVQXSHQNVBXCD730S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、かっこいい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、よねが鍋奉行で、織田奈那が一番食べてました🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJ9EJESYG3K0JDF8N80M9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったなあ〜\nまた、行こうね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、鍋が来た時に、織田奈那が拍手して喜んでたのがすごく可愛かったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKJACVGXF0025ZMQQGPKDE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}